          {
            "id": 2807105,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "My name's Liz Fuller, and I'm a running coach with Compton Park Runners Club. Welcome to my podcast. If you're thinking about taking up running, I'm here to help. There are many training programmes available online, which aim to help people build up to running five kilometres. Some of them are great, and thousands of people of all ages are taking part in five kilometre races across the country as a result.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2807106,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "My name's Liz Fuller, and I'm a running coach with Compton Park Runners Club.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 49.155,
                  "from": 44.435,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2807121,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Welcome to my podcast.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 51.235,
                  "from": 49.395,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2807126,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "If you're thinking about taking up running, I'm here to help.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 54.675,
                  "from": 51.555,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2807138,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "There are many training programmes available online, which aim to help people build up to running five kilometres.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 62.77,
                  "from": 55.49,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2807157,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Some of them are great, and thousands of people of all ages are taking part in five kilometre races across the country as a result.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 72.59499,
                  "from": 63.17,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2807183,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "People like them because they're easy to follow and don't push them too hard. However, they don't work for everyone, especially if you suffer from something like a heart condition or asthma, because they're aimed at people with average fitness and running ability. Another thing is that everyone is different, and if you have any specific questions related to your needs, there's no one to provide any answers. I have a couple of simple tips I always give to new runners. I expect you've been told to run very slowly until your fitness increases.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2807184,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "People like them because they're easy to follow and don't push them too hard.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 78.034996,
                  "from": 73.075,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2807199,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "However, they don't work for everyone, especially if you suffer from something like a heart condition or asthma, because they're aimed at people with average fitness and running ability.",
