                  "to": 90.13,
                  "from": 78.59499,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2807229,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Another thing is that everyone is different, and if you have any specific questions related to your needs, there's no one to provide any answers.",
