                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2807364,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "I don't think the time of day is especially important. Some people are better in the evening, while others are morning people. But you need to be consistent, so aim to train regularly. Twice a week is enough to begin with.",
